00:08:53.801 --> 00:08:56.734
What is going on?!
Blake Shelton, stop it!

00:08:56.734 --> 00:09:00.634
Gigi, stop it!
What is happening?!

00:09:00.634 --> 00:09:02.968
-Oh. Nut?

00:09:02.968 --> 00:09:04.033
Oh, my God!

00:09:04.033 --> 00:09:05.901
[ Funk music plays ]
Act it out?

00:09:05.901 --> 00:09:07.968
-He's drawing an actual hole
in something.

00:09:07.968 --> 00:09:11.767
-Taint? Taint?
[ Laughter ]

00:09:11.767 --> 00:09:14.200
Tent?!
I didn't say -- no.

00:09:14.200 --> 00:09:15.367
What are you drawing?
[ Buzzer ]

00:09:15.367 --> 00:09:18.334
-Can we act it out?
-Please don't act it out!

00:09:18.334 --> 00:09:20.167
Please don't act that out!

00:09:20.167 --> 00:09:21.968
Blake, get rid of
whatever that thing is.

00:09:21.968 --> 00:09:24.734
That --
What is that?

00:09:24.734 --> 00:09:27.567
What's wrong with you?
-That is a belt that is tight.

00:09:27.567 --> 00:09:29.200
-Okay. All right.
Hold on.

00:09:29.200 --> 00:09:30.767
All right.
I didn't know it was a belt.

00:09:30.767 --> 00:09:32.000
All right, it's a belt.
-Tight end!

00:09:32.000 --> 00:09:34.868
-Tight end, Gwen!
-Yes!

00:09:34.868 --> 00:09:36.701
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:09:36.701 --> 00:09:38.834
♪♪

00:09:38.834 --> 00:09:40.567
-I thought
that was something else.

00:09:40.567 --> 00:09:42.601
-100%, that's testicles.
-Oh, no, that's not --

00:09:42.601 --> 00:09:44.167
[ Laughter ]

00:09:44.167 --> 00:09:45.767
-It does start with a T.

00:09:45.767 --> 00:09:48.067
My thanks to Blake Shelton,
Gigi Hadid.

00:09:48.067 --> 00:09:49.300
Gwen Stefani!

00:09:49.300 --> 00:09:51.133
[ Cheers and applause ]

